<section class="shell band">
  <p class="eyebrow">A gentle self-care workbook</p>
  <h1>Effort-less Self-Care</h1>
  <div class="split split--aside">
    <div>
      <p class="lede">7 Easy Steps to Calm and Connection</p>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>Slow down and build a relationship with your body, your breath and your inner self.
        There is nothing here to fix. Notice yourself, be kind to yourself, stay curious.
        <strong>Healing begins when you learn to listen.</strong> Written by Reem Glasco, LPC-S,
        the workbook sets out seven short steps, each paired with watercolour imagery and
        journal prompts, to be used daily or whenever you need to reset.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="cta" href="/book/practice/">Try the seven steps</a>
