<section class="band band--night">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">The value of pause</p>
    <p class="quote-band">&ldquo;You start the healing process when you learn to listen to your
    body.&rdquo;</p>
    <p>The workbook shows you how to ground yourself in the present moment, one simple step at a
    time. Use the seven steps as a daily or weekly practice whenever you need to reset. Getting
    stuck is fine. Your body resisting is part of the journey. Always remember to breathe.</p>
  </div>
</section>

